 wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dugg%27s_Digging\" title=\"Dugg&#39;s Digging\">Dugg's Digging</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$14,000</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Shooting explosives</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.60.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">June 28th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<blockquote><p><i><big>\"Load this launcher up with all sorts of explosives! From bombs, to dynamite, to fireworks, this thing shoots 'em all. Just be careful where you point the darn thing! Load explosives by hovering over them.\"</big></i></p></blockquote>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Boom Blaster</b> is a piece of equipment that can be used to shoot any type of <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Explosives\" title=\"Category:Explosives\">explosive</a>, it can also store any amount of any type. it can be purchased for <span style=\"color:#1dab6f;\">$14,000</span> at <a href=\"/wiki/Dugg%27s_Digging\" title=\"Dugg&#39;s Digging\">Dugg's Digging</a>. \n</p><p>To load the Boom Blaster just hover over a loadable explosive, if it is loadable, it will turn white, click to add to the ammunition.\n</p><p>While it's assumed to take any explosive, it is unknown if it is possible to load the <a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Warhead\" title=\"Nuclear Warhead\">Nuke</a>.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902161421\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 59/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 76/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019444/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   37.686      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   37.686      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3096-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902161421 and revision id 19243. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Tools"],"links":[{"title":"Dugg's Digging","exists":true},{"title":"Ferwater Island","exists":true},{"title":"Nuclear Warhead","exists":true},{"title":"Category:Explosives","exists":true}]